WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0114: mobs.txt lists every creature WoW has loaded, not those within 40 yd.
Project rule: what WoW shows has an interactable BG3 stand-in. A boar WoW drew 47 yd
off had none (mobs.txt stopped at 40 yd, the bridge at 45), so the click fell to WoW and the 18 yd pull refused
it. mobs.txt (and wowmobs.bin, which streams what it lists) now holds every living creature in the client's
object list, the visible set the server sends by its own visibility distance; the bridge mirrors all of them.
